                                                "sense_id": "ccba3dbb-d54e-3b4d-ade4-f935b915b8f3",
                                                "text": "Tranquillo Barnetta was the grateful beneficiary of uncertain England defending and poor goalkeeping from Joe Hart as he twice saw speculative free-kicks end in the back of the net in the first half."
